{
  "about": "Party booking (issue #277), through rathena's web server. The first makes a party (/organize) and posts on the board (Ctrl+Z: levels 1-99, a note). The second searches the same range, finds the post and asks to join. The first gets the question and accepts, and the second hears it and is in the party. At the end the post is deleted and both leave.",
  "account": "",
  "slot": 0,
  "second": {"account": "2", "slot": 0},
  "steps": [
